Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paradise.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,targets I'm waiting\Nfor you to wait for you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my heart. My heart,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart. I'm waiting for\Nyou to come back. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To go back to the next day.\NI'm going to battle for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:01:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have special powers, too,\Nand he's coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, why did I have to be the\None with the crest of light?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(316,324)}Shurimon of the Wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great party, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Mimi throws the best parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suzy, wanna dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a great time, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've never been able to travel to the\Ndigital world without our digivices or D3s,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow, Kari did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not only did she not have her D3,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was transported there\Nwithout going through any gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something special\Nabout Kari that we're not aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? An email?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a digi-egg nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to keep cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going to keep cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever you're making,\Nbe sure and save me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:02:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it was a typo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to keep\Nlooking That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no control spires in that\Narea, so feel free to take your time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.71,0:03:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a digiport is opened in America
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Mimi lives there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not even morning there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't call her. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send her an email
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't walk another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta eat something now Yeah,\NI'm getting kind of hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too But we're very close to\Nfinding the new digi-egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we find that digi-egg,\NI'm going to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll do no such thing, and\Nbesides, your cholesterol's too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if we want to eat,\Nwe'll have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, digi-egg. Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other side of the lake,\NI think it's a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll save the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to sit in the\Ndigivolving or Digivolving section?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was delicious. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to recommend this restaurant to\Nall my friends who dine in the Digi World.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too. What's wrong, T.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about this place\Nis really bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've been here\Nbefore and it wasn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the last time you were\Nhere, you ordered the wrong thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready for our check, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I've only got one shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's our bill come to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$87 Digi Dollars plus tip. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have Digi-Dollars,\Nbut we have plenty of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our money's just as good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the Dark Masters left,\Nwe only accept Digi-Dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lunk-headed waiter\Nwon't take my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're being your usual blunt self.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you kids are trying\Nto skip out on the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, we have $87.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only Digi-Dollars or the\NDigi-Express card. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to recommend\Nthis restaurant to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want any human\Nworld deadbeats in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder the French detest tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:05:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now are you going to work off your\Nbill or do I have to call a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've heard\Nsomething like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we work here, we'll\Nbe late getting home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just pay the\Nnext time we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There won't be a next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed in here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get in that kitchen and\Nstart washing dishes or I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay their bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Charming. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a friend of mine I\Nbrought with me from America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mimi, it's so good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here in the DigiWorld?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy sent me an email saying there\Nwas a DigiPort open in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I thought it would be a great\Nopportunity to come visit everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since Michael's a good friend of\Nmine, I thought I'd bring him along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want everyone here to say\Nhello to a good friend of mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Betamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Betamon is really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lives in the water and uses his beta\Nslugger attack to wipe out his enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Palmon, are you sure\Nit's okay that you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the area you're protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon said he'd watch\Nit for me if I brought him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back a souvenir t-shirt I\Ndon't understand something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi How are you able to bring\NMichael to the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's easy I forgot to tell you,\NMichael has a Digivice just like us Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he has a Digivice, then he's\Na Digidestined That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his Digivice is the same\Nkind as mine and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he became a Digidestined in America at
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same time our original\Ngroup did in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us something, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are there more Digidestined\Nkids like you in America?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tell us how you became a\NDigidestined in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tell me you're single. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is everything\Nhappened four summers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.38,0:06:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ago when I first saw\NGorilla Mon in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was simply another ape\Nclimbing the Empire State Building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same time my Otis\NMon was taking over Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.'s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, that's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that means\Nwe all had an encounter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the Digimon at the exact same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I was on\Nthat airplane that had
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make an emergency landing in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it then, but that's\Nwhen I saw my first Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember that, Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was one of the people being held at\Nthe convention center by the Bakemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could say that Summer was as
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrifying for me as it\Nwas for all of you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't because nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I did send a bunch of emails\Nduring the battle with Diaboramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then everyone was involved somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like we're all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's still one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's going to pay the bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire meal is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.53,0:07:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I remember where I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to be one of\NMyotismond's henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made Matt and Joe\Nwork in the kitchen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got really mad when Matt asked if\Nhe could get half price on his meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he used\Nto be one of the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I admit it, that was a\Nrotten egg, but that was in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.14,0:07:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the Dark Masters were all defeated,\NI knew I had to break out of my shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a whole new man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all very proud of you\Nsince you changed your ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you feel a lot\Nbetter about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you mention it, it is\Nkind of nice making an honest living.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to me you're still one of the\Nbad guys after the way you treated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone gets a little cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he says he's changed, I believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's easy to\Nget cranky with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I really feel pretty bad\Nabout how I treated you last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had a change of heart, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it didn't seem like that when he was\Nyelling at us for trying to eat and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess I'll give him\Nthe benefit of the doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Digitamamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're not a total loser anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want your pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work it over now. Huh?\NRelax. Don't get upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was just trying to\Nmake you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Yoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we always\Nintended to pay the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would have been more patient,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we probably could have\Navoided this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brains have been scrambled lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to look at the sunny side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.22,0:08:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And someday I might even have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, forget the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Mimi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire you because no matter who you\Nmeet, you bring out the best in everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I saved you some Digi-Dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone has a crush on Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone has a crush on Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I never get the cute guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be an earthquake, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gorillamon! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out for his energy cannon\Nattack, it'll drive you bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a dark spiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that the dark spirals only\Nworked on ultimate level Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they can control champion level Digimon\Ntoo, then there must be different kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uruji-Tarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digitamamon! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digitamamon tried to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get here before he gets us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kunemon, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Betamon? Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Betamon, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zedramon's your Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still get chills remembering his\Nice blast and ice winder attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that they're in the\Nwater, Seadramon will win!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under deep carbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Palmon, you better\Ndigivolve and help Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready when you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Seadramon, time for that champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seadramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightspeed Jemmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry we had to treat you so rough,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was the only way to\Nget that Dark Spiral off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be safe from now on, but\Nstay away from the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without that Dark Spiral, he doesn't\Nseem like a bad little monkey after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think any Digimon is born evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when they get those\Ndark spirals on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're not responsible for their actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when I told you\Nabout the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He captures the Digimon\Nand makes them his slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would a young kid want to\Ntake over the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when he could be playing polo\Nor practicing the violin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To him, it's a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know what\Nmy hobby is, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys don't count, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Digitamamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to protect us,\Nand now he's gone, he—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could be all alone\Nsomewhere scared and hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry curry and i\Nwill go off and look for him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm sure they'll be able to find\Nhim in no time i hope so huh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this fast enough? Did\Nyou, Tomomon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes no thanks to you we're so glad\Nyou're back Yeah, well, don't be,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because now I'm going to make you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who wants to be destroyed first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Digitama Mon, we're your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tried to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, careful, he's\Nacting differently now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I was soft and runny,\Nbut now I'm hard-boiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can penetrate my shell,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I poach my enemies with\Nmy Nightmare Syndrome attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their minds get cracked
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Mimi! Well, Yodi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm! Digi Armor Energia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Hawkmon Armor Digivolve to\NDigimon Digimon Digimon You're a champion
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piximon: The Wings of Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Armor Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the fire of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon, the drill of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need an egg kraken attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of our attacks are working on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have to leave\NDigitamamon alone right now! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you tell them "You're being\Ncontrolled by something evil"? Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:15:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you said to us in the restaurant\Nthat you're not like that anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not being controlled by anything\Nthe one in the restaurant was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.14,0:15:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the real me I refuse to\Nbelieve that that's your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us attack him No, I'm sure\Nif I can just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll come around, but Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's evil, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's scramble that egg I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you tell them once\Nnot even our friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think back to the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when you said that\None day you hoped to have friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, today is that day\Nbecause we're your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that was just a trick so\Nyou'd let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.90,0:15:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like when I said forget the bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which reminds me you still\Nowe me 87 digi dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how rough and tough\Nyou try to act on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep down inside, I know you're not evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit trying to butter me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.11,0:15:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A piece of toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop pretending you\Ndon't want to be friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,otherwise you wouldn't\Nhave tried to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:15:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm pretending?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Yoli, don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can get through to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's a phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy, but I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want a piece of me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you'll do any better than her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you for a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear another\Nword from your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digitamamon, you're the\Nrudest Digimon I've ever met!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought you were just an\Nobnoxious waiter looking for a tip,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when you told everyone you\Nhad a change of personality,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave you the benefit of the doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you pushed Mimi to the ground\Nthat was absolutely the last straw,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all she was trying to do\Nwas make you our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how did you thank her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By viciously attacking\Nher without any cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi doesn't have a mean bone in her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I want you to know that I will not\Ntolerate that kind of behavior any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to be friends\Nand then call me a phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a problem judging others\Nby my first impression of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a cute-looking boy,\Nand I instantly fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never stop to think what\Nkind of person they might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could be really cool like\NTK or a real jerk like Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, those days are finally over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I promise to be as\Nsincere with people as I possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it something I said? It's the\Nnew Digi-Egg. It's got the Crest of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sincerity oh careful it must have\Nresponded to yoli when she started to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talk so sincerely about her feelings\Ni guess she sincerely thinks i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a jerk it's my second i've got two\Ndigi eggs then let's use it Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize! Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, Armor Digimon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shurimon, the samurai of sincerity
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Shurimon, as Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use the Digi-Egg of\NSincerity to arm a Digivolve
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My double-star's attack is\Ndouble trouble Double-star!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even you can penetrate my\Nshell Nightmare Syndrome! Digitama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect the Oli.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of Digitamamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, what's he looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the dark spiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's inside his shell. Double start!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost hit me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon. Nefertimon. Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.48,0:19:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden news!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if we have anything to say about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to take care of that\Ndark spiral, double stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He coughed up the spiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That egg is over easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had a dark spiral in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, Yoli was the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you, Yoli. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I do want to apologize for those\Nthings I said about you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.12,0:19:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I promise not\Nto judge a book by its cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I promise not to put\Nall my eggs in one basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Mimi, thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be totally honest\Nwith people, especially boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't be friends with\Nthem just because they're cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, then neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mimi, if you don't care about looks,\Nhow would you like to go on a date with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll take that as a no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now I know what to do if\Nsomeone asks me out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Michael, it was\Npretty cool meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I hope we'll get to hang\Nout together again real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.93,0:20:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi's always telling me stories\Nabout how great all of you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now I know it, too, firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, before I go, there's one thing\NI wanted to do since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Lee, I want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to go out\Non a date with me sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friday night's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or any other night works too!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can understand that...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna feel...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.58,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a future...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a wind...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.58,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:22:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the night, the\Nsound of the door is open.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will be in the morning, and\Nthe wind will be in the morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to let you know\Nwhat I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous love!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to let you know what I want.
